          "id": "code-ml-34-1-ch34_1_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy & SciPy QMC: Low Effective Dimensionality (D=6, d_eff=2) — Grid vs Random vs Sobol 2^6",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "34_1_grid_random_sobol_low_dim_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import qmc\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# First-Principles NumPy & SciPy QMC: Low Effective Dimensionality (D=6, d_eff=2)\n# Fungsi kerugian validasi riil f(x) = g_aktif(x0, x1) + 0.01 * noise(x2..x5)\n# dengan optimum global eksak f* = 0.0 di (x0*=0.31, x1*=0.67, x2..x5=0.50).\n# Bandingkan anggaran IDENTIK T = 64 (= 2^6) pada:\n#   1. Grid Search 6D (2^6 = 64 -> hanya 2 nilai unik per sumbu penting!)\n#   2. Random Search Uniform (64 nilai unik pada x0 dan x1!)\n#   3. Scrambled Sobol Quasi-Random (64 nilai unik + low-discrepancy!)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\ndef eval_low_eff_loss(U: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    active = 12.0 * (U[:, 0] - 0.31) ** 2 + 10.0 * (U[:, 1] - 0.67) ** 2\n    weak = 0.01 * np.sum((U[:, 2:] - 0.50) ** 2, axis=1)\n    return active + weak\n\n# 1. Grid Search 6D: 2 titik/dimensi (0.25, 0.75) -> total 2^6 = 64 titik\naxes = [np.array([0.25, 0.75]) for _ in range(6)]\ngrid_pts = np.stack(np.meshgrid(*axes, indexing=\"ij\"), axis=-1).reshape(-1, 6)\ngrid_best = float(eval_low_eff_loss(grid_pts).min())\ngrid_disc_2d = float(qmc.discrepancy(grid_pts[:, :2], method=\"CD\"))\n\n# 2. 30 Ulangan Monte Carlo: Random Uniform vs Scrambled Sobol (T=64 = 2^6)\nrng = np.random.default_rng(341)\nn_reps, T = 30, 64\nrand_bests, sobol_bests = [], []\nrand_discs, sobol_discs = [], []\nfor rep in range(n_reps):\n    U_rand = rng.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=(T, 6))\n    U_sobol = qmc.Sobol(d=6, scramble=True, rng=np.random.default_rng(1000 + rep)).random_base2(m=6)\n\n    rand_bests.append(float(eval_low_eff_loss(U_rand).min()))\n    sobol_bests.append(float(eval_low_eff_loss(U_sobol).min()))\n    rand_discs.append(float(qmc.discrepancy(U_rand[:, :2], method=\"CD\")))\n    sobol_discs.append(float(qmc.discrepancy(U_sobol[:, :2], method=\"CD\")))\n\nrand_arr, sobol_arr = np.array(rand_bests), np.array(sobol_bests)\nprint(f\"=== Low Effective Dimensionality Benchmark (D=6, d_eff=2, T={T}, Exact f*=0.00000) ===\")\nprint(f\"Grid 2^6 (64 eval)  | Unique(x0)={len(np.unique(grid_pts[:,0])):2d} | Best={grid_best:.5f} | 2D CD-Disc={grid_disc_2d:.5f}\")\nprint(f\"Random Uniform (30x)| Unique(x0)={T:2d} | MeanBest={rand_arr.mean():.5f} (p90={np.percentile(rand_arr,90):.5f}) | 2D CD-Disc={np.mean(rand_discs):.5f}\")\nprint(f\"Sobol QMC 2^6 (30x) | Unique(x0)={T:2d} | MeanBest={sobol_arr.mean():.5f} (p90={np.percentile(sobol_arr,90):.5f}) | 2D CD-Disc={np.mean(sobol_discs):.5f}\")\nprint(f\"Rasio Pengurangan Regret: Sobol vs Grid = {grid_best/sobol_arr.mean():.2f}x | Sobol vs Random (p90) = {np.percentile(rand_arr,90)/np.percentile(sobol_arr,90):.2f}x\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Low Effective Dimensionality Benchmark (D=6, d_eff=2, T=64, Exact f*=0.00000) ===\nGrid 2^6 (64 eval)  | Unique(x0)= 2 | Best=0.10970 | 2D CD-Disc=0.04666\nRandom Uniform (30x)| Unique(x0)=64 | MeanBest=0.04775 (p90=0.10006) | 2D CD-Disc=0.00671\nSobol QMC 2^6 (30x) | Unique(x0)=64 | MeanBest=0.03951 (p90=0.06865) | 2D CD-Disc=0.00016\nRasio Pengurangan Regret: Sobol vs Grid = 2.78x | Sobol vs Random (p90) = 1.46x",
          "actualOutput": "=== Low Effective Dimensionality Benchmark (D=6, d_eff=2, T=64, Exact f*=0.00000) ===\nGrid 2^6 (64 eval)  | Unique(x0)= 2 | Best=0.10970 | 2D CD-Disc=0.04666\nRandom Uniform (30x)| Unique(x0)=64 | MeanBest=0.04775 (p90=0.10006) | 2D CD-Disc=0.00671\nSobol QMC 2^6 (30x) | Unique(x0)=64 | MeanBest=0.03951 (p90=0.06865) | 2D CD-Disc=0.00016\nRasio Pengurangan Regret: Sobol vs Grid = 2.78x | Sobol vs Random (p90) = 1.46x",
          "explanation": "Membandingkan anggaran identik T=64 pada fungsi 6D berdimensi efektif 2: Grid 2^6 hanya menguji 2 nilai unik per sumbu penting (Best=0.10970), sedangkan Random dan Sobol menguji 64 nilai unik dengan Sobol memangkas regret 2.78x atas Grid, memangkas p90 worst-case 1.46x atas Random, dan menurunkan 2D Centered Discrepancy 41x (0.00016 vs 0.00671).",
