          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Non-Dominated Sorting & 2D Hypervolume (Ref=[1.0, 1.0]) ===\n  Front F1: ['M0(Akurat-Lambat)', 'M1(Cekung-A)', 'M2(Cekung-Knee)', 'M3(Cekung-B)', 'M4(Cepat-Kasar)']\n  Front F2: ['M5(Dominated)', 'M6(Dominated)']\n  Exact 2D Hypervolume Front F1 = 0.360800\n\n=== 2. Bukti Kegagalan Linear Scalarization pada Frontier Non-Konveks ===\n  Jumlah titik Pareto sejati (F1)       : 5 -> ['M0(Akurat-Lambat)', 'M1(Cekung-A)', 'M2(Cekung-Knee)', 'M3(Cekung-B)', 'M4(Cepat-Kasar)']\n  Titik yang PERNAH menang Linear w*f1+(1-w)f2 (1001 bobot): ['M0(Akurat-Lambat)', 'M4(Cepat-Kasar)']\n  Titik Pareto MUSTAHIL ditemukan Linear Scalarization     : ['M1(Cekung-A)', 'M2(Cekung-Knee)', 'M3(Cekung-B)'] <-- BUTA TOTAL!",
