          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: 3D Pareto HPO HistGBDT — Juara Tunggal Ditolak SLA vs Pareto Knee Hemat 62.3% Latensi & 62.5% Size",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "34_4_sklearn_3d_pareto_hgbdt_sla_gate.py",
          "code": "import pickle\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import qmc\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier\nfrom sklearn.metrics import average_precision_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Scikit-Learn 1.9: Multi-Objective 3D Pareto HPO (PR-AUC vs p99_est vs Size KB)\n# Menggunakan node count aktual (_predictors) & pickle.dumps bytes -> 100% deterministik!\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nX, y = make_classification(\n    n_samples=700, n_features=18, n_informative=8, n_redundant=4,\n    weights=[0.85, 0.15], class_sep=1.35, flip_y=0.02, random_state=3442\n)\nX_tr, X_val, y_tr, y_val = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.30, stratify=y, random_state=42)\n\nU = qmc.Sobol(d=3, scramble=True, rng=np.random.default_rng(42)).random_base2(m=5)  # 32 kandidat Sobol 2^5\nrecords = []\nfor tid, u in enumerate(U):\n    max_iter = int(round(12 + 168 * u[0]))\n    max_leaf = int(round(6 + 58 * u[1]))\n    lr = float(10.0 ** (-1.8 + 1.4 * u[2]))\n\n    clf = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(\n        max_iter=max_iter,\n        max_leaf_nodes=max_leaf,\n        learning_rate=lr,\n        max_bins=32,\n        early_stopping=False,\n        random_state=42,\n    ).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\n    pr_auc = float(average_precision_score(y_val, clf.predict_proba(X_val)[:, 1]))\n    size_kb = len(pickle.dumps(clf)) / 1024.0\n    total_nodes = sum(len(p[0].nodes) for p in clf._predictors)\n    est_p99 = 0.80 + 0.0032 * total_nodes + 0.015 * size_kb\n    records.append({\n        \"id\": tid, \"max_iter\": max_iter, \"max_leaf\": max_leaf, \"lr\": lr,\n        \"pr_auc\": pr_auc, \"err\": 1.0 - pr_auc, \"p99\": est_p99, \"size_kb\": size_kb,\n    })\n\nC = np.array([[r[\"err\"], r[\"p99\"], r[\"size_kb\"]] for r in records])\nis_pareto = np.ones(len(records), dtype=bool)\nfor i in range(len(records)):\n    for j in range(len(records)):\n        if i != j and np.all(C[j] <= C[i]) and np.any(C[j] < C[i]):\n            is_pareto[i] = False\n            break\n\nSLA_P99, SLA_KB = 10.0, 150.0\nbest_single = max(records, key=lambda r: r[\"pr_auc\"])\npareto_recs = sorted([r for r, p in zip(records, is_pareto) if p], key=lambda r: r[\"p99\"])\nfeasible_pareto = [r for r in pareto_recs if r[\"p99\"] <= SLA_P99 and r[\"size_kb\"] <= SLA_KB]\nwinner_sla = max(feasible_pareto, key=lambda r: r[\"pr_auc\"])\n\nprint(f\"=== Multi-Objective 3D Pareto HPO ({len(records)} Kandidat Sobol | SLA: p99<={SLA_P99:.0f}, Size<={SLA_KB:.0f}KB) ===\")\nprint(f\"Total Titik Pareto 3D: {len(pareto_recs)}/{len(records)} | Lolos Hard SLA: {len(feasible_pareto)}\")\nprint(f\"\\n[ANTI-PATTERN] Juara #1 Single-Objective PR-AUC (Trial #{best_single['id']:02d}):\")\nprint(f\"  PR-AUC={best_single['pr_auc']:.4f} | p99_est={best_single['p99']:.2f} | Size={best_single['size_kb']:.1f}KB | Status={'LOLOS' if best_single['p99']<=SLA_P99 and best_single['size_kb']<=SLA_KB else 'DITOLAK (MELANGGAR SLA!)'}\")\nprint(f\"\\n[PARETO-SLA] Pemenang Pareto Feasible Terbaik (Trial #{winner_sla['id']:02d}):\")\nprint(f\"  PR-AUC={winner_sla['pr_auc']:.4f} | p99_est={winner_sla['p99']:.2f} | Size={winner_sla['size_kb']:.1f}KB | Delta PR-AUC={winner_sla['pr_auc']-best_single['pr_auc']:+.4f} | Hemat p99={(1-winner_sla['p99']/best_single['p99'])*100:.1f}% | Hemat Size={(1-winner_sla['size_kb']/best_single['size_kb'])*100:.1f}%\")\nprint(\"\\nSeluruh 6 Titik pada 3D Pareto Frontier (urut p99_est):\")\nfor r in pareto_recs:\n    tag = \"OK-SLA\" if (r[\"p99\"] <= SLA_P99 and r[\"size_kb\"] <= SLA_KB) else \"OVER-SLA\"\n    print(f\"  Trial #{r['id']:02d} ({r['max_iter']:3d} trees, {r['max_leaf']:2d} leaves) | PR-AUC={r['pr_auc']:.4f} | p99_est={r['p99']:5.2f} | Size={r['size_kb']:6.1f}KB [{tag}]\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Multi-Objective 3D Pareto HPO (32 Kandidat Sobol | SLA: p99<=10, Size<=150KB) ===\nTotal Titik Pareto 3D: 6/32 | Lolos Hard SLA: 3\n\n[ANTI-PATTERN] Juara #1 Single-Objective PR-AUC (Trial #14):\n  PR-AUC=0.9682 | p99_est=14.61 | Size=204.1KB | Status=DITOLAK (MELANGGAR SLA!)\n\n[PARETO-SLA] Pemenang Pareto Feasible Terbaik (Trial #03):\n  PR-AUC=0.9582 | p99_est=5.50 | Size=76.5KB | Delta PR-AUC=-0.0100 | Hemat p99=62.3% | Hemat Size=62.5%\n\nSeluruh 6 Titik pada 3D Pareto Frontier (urut p99_est):\n  Trial #24 ( 16 trees, 38 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.8252 | p99_est= 2.85 | Size=  35.4KB [OK-SLA]\n  Trial #23 ( 23 trees, 12 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9441 | p99_est= 3.07 | Size=  39.0KB [OK-SLA]\n  Trial #03 ( 74 trees,  8 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9582 | p99_est= 5.50 | Size=  76.5KB [OK-SLA]\n  Trial #05 (155 trees, 14 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9605 | p99_est=10.78 | Size= 155.4KB [OVER-SLA]\n  Trial #11 ( 88 trees, 22 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9629 | p99_est=11.13 | Size= 154.3KB [OVER-SLA]\n  Trial #14 (116 trees, 53 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9682 | p99_est=14.61 | Size= 204.1KB [OVER-SLA]",
          "actualOutput": "=== Multi-Objective 3D Pareto HPO (32 Kandidat Sobol | SLA: p99<=10, Size<=150KB) ===\nTotal Titik Pareto 3D: 6/32 | Lolos Hard SLA: 3\n\n[ANTI-PATTERN] Juara #1 Single-Objective PR-AUC (Trial #14):\n  PR-AUC=0.9682 | p99_est=14.61 | Size=204.1KB | Status=DITOLAK (MELANGGAR SLA!)\n\n[PARETO-SLA] Pemenang Pareto Feasible Terbaik (Trial #03):\n  PR-AUC=0.9582 | p99_est=5.50 | Size=76.5KB | Delta PR-AUC=-0.0100 | Hemat p99=62.3% | Hemat Size=62.5%\n\nSeluruh 6 Titik pada 3D Pareto Frontier (urut p99_est):\n  Trial #24 ( 16 trees, 38 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.8252 | p99_est= 2.85 | Size=  35.4KB [OK-SLA]\n  Trial #23 ( 23 trees, 12 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9441 | p99_est= 3.07 | Size=  39.0KB [OK-SLA]\n  Trial #03 ( 74 trees,  8 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9582 | p99_est= 5.50 | Size=  76.5KB [OK-SLA]\n  Trial #05 (155 trees, 14 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9605 | p99_est=10.78 | Size= 155.4KB [OVER-SLA]\n  Trial #11 ( 88 trees, 22 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9629 | p99_est=11.13 | Size= 154.3KB [OVER-SLA]\n  Trial #14 (116 trees, 53 leaves) | PR-AUC=0.9682 | p99_est=14.61 | Size= 204.1KB [OVER-SLA]",
